00:01:01.919 --> 00:01:05.791
(boom)
- Where does discipline

00:01:05.791 --> 00:01:06.958
come from?

00:01:08.725 --> 00:01:11.111
(slow serious music)
It's pretty simple

00:01:11.111 --> 00:01:13.465
and pretty obvious.

00:01:13.465 --> 00:01:16.132
Discipline comes from within.

00:01:17.891 --> 00:01:19.808
It's an internal force.

00:01:21.471 --> 00:01:25.519
Now sure, of course you can
have discipline imposed on you

00:01:25.519 --> 00:01:29.807
by some person like a drill instructor

00:01:29.807 --> 00:01:31.890
or like that

00:01:33.083 --> 00:01:35.865
self-help guru on TV.

00:01:35.865 --> 00:01:39.237
But the reality is that type of discipline

00:01:39.237 --> 00:01:42.830
isn't the real type of discipline
that we're talking about.

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:46.997
That discipline isn't as
strong, it won't survive.

00:01:47.851 --> 00:01:51.806
What you need is self-discipline.

00:01:51.806 --> 00:01:53.636
(exciting powerful music)

00:01:53.636 --> 00:01:56.423
Now self-discipline comes from the self,

00:01:56.423 --> 00:01:57.923
it comes from you.

00:02:00.031 --> 00:02:03.198
It comes from when you make a decision

00:02:05.364 --> 00:02:06.864
to be disciplined,

00:02:08.405 --> 00:02:10.963
when you make a decision to be better,

00:02:10.963 --> 00:02:15.130
when you make a decision
to do more and to be more.

00:02:16.555 --> 00:02:19.638
Self-discipline comes when you decide

00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:24.167
that you're going to
make a mark on the world.

00:02:24.167 --> 00:02:28.247
And if you think that
you're not disciplined

00:02:28.247 --> 00:02:30.710
or you can't be disciplined, it's because

00:02:30.710 --> 00:02:34.627
you haven't yet decided to be disciplined.

00:02:35.860 --> 00:02:40.645
It's because you haven't
created that discipline

00:02:40.645 --> 00:02:43.645
yet.
(stormy music)

00:02:46.297 --> 00:02:50.606
So make the decision, make the commitment.

00:02:50.606 --> 00:02:54.592
Discipline, the root
quality that will improve

00:02:54.592 --> 00:02:58.963
every aspect of your
life and it'll make you

00:02:58.963 --> 00:03:02.049
better and stronger and smarter

00:03:02.049 --> 00:03:04.132
and faster and healthier.

00:03:05.837 --> 00:03:07.420
And most important,

00:03:11.269 --> 00:03:12.936
it'll make you free.

00:03:15.554 --> 00:03:18.003
I don't really like those words.

00:03:18.003 --> 00:03:22.086
Self-help or self-management
or self-improvement,

00:03:23.532 --> 00:03:25.178
I don't really like what those words have

00:03:25.178 --> 00:03:27.178
come to mean these days.

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:30.640
Cuz there's a lot of people
out there that are constantly

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:33.768
trying to improve themselves

00:03:33.768 --> 00:03:37.083
by looking for the one change,

00:03:37.083 --> 00:03:39.956
the one change right, the
one change in their life

00:03:39.956 --> 00:03:43.373
that's going to make
their dreams come true.

00:03:44.709 --> 00:03:47.712
And even worse, on top of
that, there's a lot of people

00:03:47.712 --> 00:03:51.229
out there, a lot of
self-help gurus and these

00:03:51.229 --> 00:03:54.913
hyperactive motivational
speakers and these other

00:03:54.913 --> 00:03:59.233
self-appointed modern
zen yoga warriors that

00:03:59.233 --> 00:04:02.882
they're trying to sell the one
thing, they're trying to sell

00:04:02.882 --> 00:04:05.878
the nine steps or the
enlightened path that's going to

00:04:05.878 --> 00:04:09.807
allow you to unlock all
of your human potential

00:04:09.807 --> 00:04:13.102
and fulfill the dreams
so you can live the life

00:04:13.102 --> 00:04:15.935
that you've always wanted to live.

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:21.167
Now, I'm no guru

00:04:22.246 --> 00:04:24.096
and I definitely don't claim to be.

00:04:24.096 --> 00:04:25.929
I'm just a man.

00:04:27.428 --> 00:04:29.315
But I will tell you this.

00:04:29.315 --> 00:04:33.584
It isn't one thing and it isn't 10 things

00:04:33.584 --> 00:04:37.180
and it isn't a hundred
things, it isn't a quick path

00:04:37.180 --> 00:04:40.180
and there are no shortcuts.

00:04:41.833 --> 00:04:45.395
And meditation won't get
you there and neither will

00:04:45.395 --> 00:04:49.562
a miracle drug or an organic
supplement or some super food.

00:04:52.367 --> 00:04:55.905
Getting better isn't a hack or a trick

00:04:55.905 --> 00:04:59.072
or a one change that you need to make.

00:05:00.706 --> 00:05:04.674
Getting better is a
campaign, it's a campaign,

00:05:04.674 --> 00:05:08.507
it's a daily, a weekly,
it's an hourly fight.

00:05:10.297 --> 00:05:13.944
An incessant fight that
doesn't stop against weakness

00:05:13.944 --> 00:05:16.494
and against temptation
and against laziness.

00:05:16.494 --> 00:05:19.471
It's a campaign of discipline.

00:05:19.471 --> 00:05:22.240
It's a campaign of hard
work and dedication.

00:05:22.240 --> 00:05:24.847
It's waking up early and going to bed late

00:05:24.847 --> 00:05:28.393
and grinding out every second in between.

00:05:28.393 --> 00:05:30.310
Every single day.

00:05:33.677 --> 00:05:36.510
So you want to get better?

00:05:37.534 --> 00:05:40.083
You want to self-improve?

00:05:40.083 --> 00:05:42.333
Stop looking for a shortcut

00:05:43.613 --> 00:05:45.705
and go find your alarm clock

00:05:45.705 --> 00:05:48.511
and find your discipline

00:05:48.511 --> 00:05:52.430
and find your guts and
your passion and your drive

00:05:52.430 --> 00:05:54.263
and find your will.

00:05:57.200 --> 00:05:58.533
And then,

00:06:00.043 --> 00:06:02.793
and then you will find

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:05.705
your freedom.

00:06:05.705 --> 00:06:09.872
Those days when I'm tired or warn out

00:06:11.024 --> 00:06:15.191
or just basically sick of the grind,

00:06:17.597 --> 00:06:19.847
what do I do on those days?

00:06:21.729 --> 00:06:23.146
I go anyways,

00:06:24.872 --> 00:06:27.442
I get it done even if

00:06:27.442 --> 00:06:29.940
I'm just going through the motions,

00:06:29.940 --> 00:06:32.357
I go through the motions.

00:06:33.656 --> 00:06:36.014
I don't really want to workout?

00:06:36.014 --> 00:06:37.097
I work out.

00:06:38.092 --> 00:06:41.997
I really don't want to
hammer on a project?

00:06:41.997 --> 00:06:43.997
I hammer on the project.

00:06:45.284 --> 00:06:49.034
Don't really want to get
up and get out of bed?

00:06:50.660 --> 00:06:54.160
Yeah, I get up and get out of bed.

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:59.539
Now these could be signals

00:06:59.539 --> 00:07:03.337
that you need some time off.

00:07:03.337 --> 00:07:06.087
And those signals might be right,

00:07:07.264 --> 00:07:09.431
they could be correct but

00:07:10.274 --> 00:07:13.471
don't take today off, not today.

00:07:13.471 --> 00:07:15.811
Wait until tomorrow.

00:07:15.811 --> 00:07:20.029
Don't give in to the
immediate gratification

00:07:20.029 --> 00:07:22.862
that is whispering in your ear.

00:07:25.171 --> 00:07:29.901
Shut that down, do not
listen to that little voice.

00:07:29.901 --> 00:07:34.068
Instead, go through the
motions, lift the weights,

00:07:34.966 --> 00:07:38.263
sprint the hill, work on the project,

00:07:38.263 --> 00:07:40.346
get out of bed.

00:07:43.197 --> 00:07:47.364
Now as an overall rule, I
do not like procrastination.

00:07:48.321 --> 00:07:50.654
You need to get things done.

00:07:53.999 --> 00:07:58.230
But if you are going to rest,

00:07:58.230 --> 00:08:02.123
that is one thing that you
should procrastinate on.

00:08:02.123 --> 00:08:05.931
That's the one thing I want
you to put off until tomorrow.

00:08:05.931 --> 00:08:08.764
And if when tomorrow comes,

00:08:09.978 --> 00:08:13.434
you still feel like you need to rest

00:08:13.434 --> 00:08:14.936
or you need to take a break,

00:08:14.936 --> 00:08:18.269
then okay, take it.

00:08:20.395 --> 00:08:23.636
But the chances are you won't.

00:08:23.636 --> 00:08:25.164
You won't need that rest.

00:08:25.164 --> 00:08:27.489
The chances are you will realize that

00:08:27.489 --> 00:08:30.564
the desire to rest was just weakness,

00:08:30.564 --> 00:08:33.546
it was just the desire to take

00:08:33.546 --> 00:08:36.098
the path of least resistance,

00:08:36.098 --> 00:08:38.848
the downhill path, the easy path.

00:08:41.217 --> 00:08:44.550
And by simply going through the motions,

00:08:46.703 --> 00:08:50.797
you overcame that path and you
stayed on the righteous path,

00:08:50.797 --> 00:08:54.714
the disciplined path,
you stayed on the warpath

00:08:57.388 --> 00:09:00.055
which is right where you know

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:03.269
that you belong.

00:09:03.269 --> 00:09:06.186
So I want to tell you something else

00:09:06.186 --> 00:09:08.519
and I want to make this clear.

00:09:10.410 --> 00:09:13.330
Don't just listen.

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:16.163
Don't just listen, do.

00:09:19.757 --> 00:09:22.695
I'm not just talking, so you know,

00:09:22.695 --> 00:09:26.362
I'm not just talking, I'm doing

00:09:27.817 --> 00:09:30.607
and I don't want you to just listen.

00:09:30.607 --> 00:09:33.690
Put his information to work.

00:09:36.425 --> 00:09:39.425
Make today count,

00:09:40.431 --> 00:09:41.514
every day.

00:09:43.410 --> 00:09:47.414
Go forward, get aggressive and attack

00:09:47.414 --> 00:09:51.581
whether it's on the
battlefield or on the beat,

00:09:53.562 --> 00:09:57.511
or in the factory or on the farm or on

00:09:57.511 --> 00:10:00.844
the construction site or on the website,

00:10:02.438 --> 00:10:05.355
in the garage, or in the firehouse,

00:10:06.284 --> 00:10:10.034
don't hesitate, step.

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:14.040
Step forward

00:10:16.643 --> 00:10:18.147
and get after it.

00:10:18.147 --> 00:10:22.270
There's so much knowledge out
there, so much information,

00:10:22.270 --> 00:10:24.437
so many ways to get better

00:10:27.486 --> 00:10:28.903
and we make,

00:10:30.158 --> 00:10:32.241
we make so many mistakes.

00:10:34.248 --> 00:10:37.788
We're the product of our mistakes

00:10:37.788 --> 00:10:41.705
and often times the
lesson is sitting there

00:10:42.546 --> 00:10:44.668
right in front of our face.

00:10:44.668 --> 00:10:46.560
It's there to be learned but we miss it

00:10:46.560 --> 00:10:50.727
or we don't pay attention to
it or we think we know better

00:10:52.359 --> 00:10:56.526
until it punches us in the face.

00:11:00.559 --> 00:11:03.611
And the most important
thing to learn is that

00:11:03.611 --> 00:11:08.415
we have so much to learn, we all do.

00:11:08.415 --> 00:11:11.804
And we can learn from
school and from people

00:11:11.804 --> 00:11:15.387
and from experience
and we learn from life.

00:11:19.411 --> 00:11:23.593
But you have to process the information,

00:11:23.593 --> 00:11:26.827
you have to absorb it,
you have to accept it,

00:11:26.827 --> 00:11:30.994
you have to open your mind,
you've got to free your mind

00:11:31.993 --> 00:11:34.160
so that you can learn

00:11:35.240 --> 00:11:38.157
and make real progress.

00:11:43.614 --> 00:11:47.760
And as far as regrets and things I wish

00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:50.843
I would have done differently, of course.

00:11:51.687 --> 00:11:55.766
Hindsight, hindsight is 20 20

00:11:55.766 --> 00:11:57.299
and looking back of course,

00:11:57.299 --> 00:11:59.976
who wouldn't want to take
another go at something

00:11:59.976 --> 00:12:04.473
and improve on the first
try by doing it again?

00:12:04.473 --> 00:12:08.129
And then why not do it
again and again and again

00:12:08.129 --> 00:12:11.194
and why not just do it over and over again

00:12:11.194 --> 00:12:13.694
until you have it perfect?

00:12:17.708 --> 00:12:21.875
But the fact is, you
don't get that chance.

00:12:24.400 --> 00:12:28.758
You get one shot, one shot

00:12:28.758 --> 00:12:32.341
at this gig right here, life.

00:12:33.558 --> 00:12:36.225
One life, that's all you've got.

00:12:37.505 --> 00:12:41.005
And regret, in and of itself,

00:12:43.550 --> 00:12:47.646
it's worthless, it does nothing for you.

00:12:47.646 --> 00:12:50.834
In fact, the only valuable thing in regret

00:12:50.834 --> 00:12:53.334
is the lesson you learned.

00:12:54.951 --> 00:12:57.451
The knowledge that you gained.

00:12:59.228 --> 00:13:02.311
But walking around filled with regret

00:13:03.215 --> 00:13:04.965
gets you nothing.

00:13:07.347 --> 00:13:10.764
So, learn and move on.

00:13:11.698 --> 00:13:14.506
Don't let regret beat you down,

00:13:14.506 --> 00:13:17.339
don't be a slave to regret, no.

00:13:18.467 --> 00:13:22.134
Let it teach you, let it make you better.

00:13:25.214 --> 00:13:29.009
Let the fear of regret fuel you

00:13:29.009 --> 00:13:32.426
to take action today, now.

00:13:35.295 --> 00:13:38.776
To take action now to become

00:13:38.776 --> 00:13:42.943
a better person not filled with regret,

00:13:45.993 --> 00:13:48.160
but filled with knowledge.

00:13:52.559 --> 00:13:56.805
Filled with knowledge
and strength and power

00:13:56.805 --> 00:14:01.025
and filled with life.

00:14:01.025 --> 00:14:04.405
Any type of danger right gives you this

00:14:04.405 --> 00:14:07.568
flight or fight response, so train.

00:14:07.568 --> 00:14:08.608
It starts with training.

00:14:08.608 --> 00:14:11.706
Jujitsu, boxing, Muay Thai, wrestling,

00:14:11.706 --> 00:14:14.853
shooting, competing, competing right?

00:14:14.853 --> 00:14:16.903
You get used to those
butterflies when you compete,

00:14:16.903 --> 00:14:20.502
you get those butterflies
and you get used to em.

00:14:20.502 --> 00:14:22.752
And so train

00:14:24.467 --> 00:14:26.415
and get used to seeing how that reaction,

00:14:26.415 --> 00:14:28.404
what that adrenaline feels like

00:14:28.404 --> 00:14:30.368
and also get used to understanding

00:14:30.368 --> 00:14:32.370
what the superior action is, right?

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:34.213
Fight or flight, cuz sometimes

00:14:34.213 --> 00:14:35.870
flight is the correct response.

00:14:35.870 --> 00:14:38.591
Sometimes fight is the correct response.

00:14:38.591 --> 00:14:41.000
But you want to do is you
want to be able to assess

00:14:41.000 --> 00:14:43.553
and dictate which response
you're going to give

00:14:43.553 --> 00:14:45.950
and not just do whatever
your instincts tells you

00:14:45.950 --> 00:14:48.710
cuz sometimes your
instinct might be wrong.

00:14:48.710 --> 00:14:53.253
And so again, I don't know
what you're actually...

00:14:53.253 --> 00:14:54.631
The situation where you're going into

00:14:54.631 --> 00:14:56.243
but whatever it is, cuz people get

00:14:56.243 --> 00:15:00.075
the fight or flight
response to everyday things,

00:15:00.075 --> 00:15:01.589
to like public speaking right?

00:15:01.589 --> 00:15:02.776
- [Interviewer] Oh yeah.

00:15:02.776 --> 00:15:05.071
- Rock climbing

00:15:05.071 --> 00:15:06.552
and an answer where I say like you know,

00:15:06.552 --> 00:15:10.622
do these things, train in them.

00:15:10.622 --> 00:15:12.575
So public speaking,
rock climbing, you know,

00:15:12.575 --> 00:15:14.429
if you want to get good at
rock, you want to get over that

