"What something is wrong and
going bad, you always just

00:16:49.947 --> 00:16:52.114
"look at me and say good."

00:16:53.507 --> 00:16:55.081
And I said, "Well yeah."
(heavy rock guitar)

00:16:55.081 --> 00:16:57.998
When things are going bad,

00:16:58.849 --> 00:17:03.024
there's going to be some good
that's going to come from it.

00:17:03.024 --> 00:17:06.099
Didn't get the new high
speed gear we wanted?

00:17:06.099 --> 00:17:07.019
Good.

00:17:07.019 --> 00:17:09.936
Didn't get promoted, good.

00:17:10.799 --> 00:17:13.036
More time to get better.

00:17:13.036 --> 00:17:14.752
Oh, mission got canceled?

00:17:14.752 --> 00:17:16.680
Good, we can focus on our other one.

00:17:16.680 --> 00:17:20.591
Didn't get funded, didn't
get the job you wanted,

00:17:20.591 --> 00:17:22.704
got injured, sprained my ankle,

00:17:22.704 --> 00:17:24.947
got tapped out, good.

00:17:24.947 --> 00:17:26.151
Got beat?

00:17:26.151 --> 00:17:28.068
Good, you learned.

00:17:30.192 --> 00:17:32.381
Unexpected problems?

00:17:32.381 --> 00:17:33.890
Good.

00:17:33.890 --> 00:17:37.973
We have the opportunity
to figure out a solution.

00:17:38.917 --> 00:17:42.657
That's it, when things are going bad,

00:17:42.657 --> 00:17:44.698
don't get all bummed
out, don't get startled,

00:17:44.698 --> 00:17:45.945
don't get frustrated

00:17:45.945 --> 00:17:50.461
(high pitch electronic echo)

00:17:50.461 --> 00:17:52.878
If you can say the word Good,

00:17:54.379 --> 00:17:57.712
guess what, it means you're still alive.

00:17:58.583 --> 00:18:00.821
It means you're still breathing.

00:18:00.821 --> 00:18:03.321
And if you're still breathing?

00:18:04.516 --> 00:18:08.775
For now, you still got
some fight left in you.

00:18:08.775 --> 00:18:12.942
So get up, dust off, reload,

00:18:14.477 --> 00:18:18.394
recalibrate, reengage

00:18:20.134 --> 00:18:21.608
and go out on the attack.

00:18:21.608 --> 00:18:24.357
(slow piano music)

00:18:24.357 --> 00:18:25.642
- Thank you guys so much for watching.

00:18:25.642 --> 00:18:27.191
I'd love to know what did you think,

00:18:27.191 --> 00:18:29.063
what did you take from this
video that you're going to

00:18:29.063 --> 00:18:32.559
immediate apply somehow to
your life or to your business?

00:18:32.559 --> 00:18:34.164
Let me know down in the comments below.

00:18:34.164 --> 00:18:35.676
I'm really curious to find out.

00:18:35.676 --> 00:18:37.546
I also want to give a
quick shout out to Brandon

00:18:37.546 --> 00:18:40.104
from OnePercentBetter,
thank you so much Brandon

00:18:40.104 --> 00:18:42.444
for picking up a copy of
my book, Your One Word

00:18:42.444 --> 00:18:45.417
and doing that awesome YouTube
review on your channel.

00:18:45.417 --> 00:18:47.192
I really appreciate the support man

00:18:47.192 --> 00:18:48.935
and I'm glad you enjoyed my book.

00:18:48.935 --> 00:18:51.188
- We are happy to have you on the channel.

00:18:51.188 --> 00:18:52.983
- Thank you guys so much for watching.

00:18:52.983 --> 00:18:54.948
I believe in you, I hope you continue to

00:18:54.948 --> 00:18:58.349
believe in yourself and
whatever your one word is,

00:18:58.349 --> 00:19:00.768
much love, I'll see you soon.

00:19:00.768 --> 00:19:03.254
(swoosh)
(bounce)

